[agent] Now I understand the task. I need to:
[agent] 1. Read the requests and profiles data
[agent] 2. Join them on account_id
[agent] 3. Compute distance_deg = sqrt((request_lat - home_lat)^2 + (request_lon - home_lon)^2), rounded to 6 decimal places
[agent] 4. Compute score = base_score - 0.1 * distance_deg (using the rounded distance), rounded to 6 decimal places
[agent] 5. Create a feature table named `scored68393f`, version 1, with columns: request_id, account_id, distance_deg, score
[agent] 6. Make it available for low-latency lookup (online/real-time access)
